WEBVTT

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.370
Total Fantasy Knockout

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:33.650
How simple.

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:36.070
Tachibana-chan's charm skill, was it?

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:38.050
It will come in handy.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:42.080
Did you make a few adjustments?

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.490
I made it go a little berserk.

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:48.180
By increasing the power of her charm, 
the hero will be physically weakened as well.

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:49.580
Two birds with one stone.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:54.700
By now, the kingdom must be busy 
dealing with the rioters near the royal capital.

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:57.730
We should have the humans destroy 
each other while we have the chance.

00:01:57.730 --> 00:01:59.080
You really are a bad guy.

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:00.390
Head maid! It's an emergency!

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:03.510
All communications from the force that 
advanced on the capital have been cut off!

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:05.220
Have they all been wiped out?

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:09.150
Well, according to our investigation, 
they've all returned to their regular lives...

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:19.240
<b><i>Feeling of Freedom!</i></b>

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:19.140
Heave-ho!

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:13.640
and seem to be plowing 
fields completely naked.

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:14.980
Why completely naked?

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:19.240
I've also heard that they've lost all 
their memories of the last few days.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:25.720
A skill that instantly dispels mind control 
from hundreds of people?

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:26.750
That can't be!

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:28.500
Will it cause problems?

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:33.000
If we made all the charmed 
hostages advance on a target,

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.940
and the charm on all of them 
was broken... what would happen?

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:41.010
Huh? If that happened, there'd be 
no point to what we're doing here...

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.760
That's really bad, right?!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.560
Is this any time to be eating cake?!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:45.560
<i>It can't be. I've spent a year on this!</i>

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.720
<i>I started with chores I didn't want 
to do, steadily working my hardest.</i>

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.810
<b>Sewing Shoes       Cleaning Toilets         Peeling Potatoes</b>

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:52.450
<i>Through meticulous preparations, 
I rose all the way to head maid.</i>

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:54.900
<b>Tables Turned!</b>

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:55.770
<i>I gathered information and finally arrived 
at a plan I knew would work, and yet...</i>

00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:00.740
<i>I failed to notice a human in this 
kingdom who could undo mind control!</i>

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.840
<i>What kind of person could do that?!</i>

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:06.880
What're you gonna do about this?! 
It's bad, right? Really bad!

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.170
Hey, what're you gonna do?

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:11.960
There's no helping it. 
It's time to end the "Kingdom Falls to Charm" plan.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:11.960
What're you gonna do, huh? 
This is really bad!

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.850
Oh. Do you still have other strategies?

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:16.550
It's all too much work at this point.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.800
Let's just blow the whole kingdom up.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.790
Yggie, what is this place?

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:29.310
This is our kingdom's 
underground weapons storage.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:33.120
Princess, there's no turning back now.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:36.320
The interference of an unknown force 
has caused our plan to collapse.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:40.070
All that's left is this last resort.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:44.850
What? One plan fails and we've 
already hit the point of no return?

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:47.370
Must've been a really stupid plan.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:51.210
I wish you'd at least think of it as 
better than using our last resort.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:56.750
But making use of the kingdom's 
defenses for my own purposes...

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.460
Are you all right leaving 
things like this, Princess?

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:03.340
You've put up with so much 
all alone, haven't you?

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:05.590
A toy like this...

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:08.370
I think you have the right to use it.

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:14.750
A confined, cold, lonely world...

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:17.260
Do you want to go back to that castle?

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:19.110
But... This seal...

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.810
it requires two members of the royal family.

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:24.860
There's no need to worry.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.290
We have someone very similar...

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.540
right here.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.480
Come, hero, you do it, too.

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:37.860
Oh, sorry. I wasn't listening.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:39.420
I told you, didn't I?

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:41.170
A way to get stronger.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:44.550
I said I'd teach you how.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:55.240
Let's go with the princess 
to defeat Jinguuji-sama.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:57.700
Jinguuji?

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:07.580
Let's see. Manual, manual... Oh, here it is!

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:11.080
What will we do with this?

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:15.080
I don't like the idea of making 
threats using military force!

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:19.000
"What," you ask? That should be obvious.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:26.840
You've worked me quite 
hard for the last year.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:31.350
The next thing you'll see is your 
kingdom as a field of flames!

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:36.850
All kinds of things have 
been pent up around here.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.180
Hey, what're we gonna do about this one?

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:41.860
Oh, the hero? It will be 
a source of motive power.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:47.080
We'll use up all that excessive
 goddess power of yours.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.110
Motive power?

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.360
What's "motive power"?

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.870
Now, let us go, Vizzd-chan!

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:56.620
Switch on!

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:04.630
Episode 11

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:04.630
A Guy Who Reincarnated as a Fantasy Knockout .
and a Weapon for the Final Battle                         .

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:09.010
What is this?

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.960
Jinguuji-san! There!

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.900
Kersmash!

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.660
Kersmash!

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.100
Hey, Shen. What is that thing?

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.380
What could that thing be?

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.250
Are you joking around right now?

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:40.420
<i>His confusion is so great 
it's turned into rage.</i>

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:42.010
That's...

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:43.960
Interrogator, do you know it?

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:45.360
It's cute.

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:46.050
Is it?!

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:51.200
I mean... It resembles a creature 
I saw in a book a long time ago.

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:53.550
Crash! Crash! Crash!

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.550
A presence that would act as the 
guardian deity of this kingdom.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.660
By guardian deity, do you mean one of <i>those</i>...

00:06:56.660 --> 00:07:00.440
Long ears and an extremely large body.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:05.070
Light comes from its mouth, 
and it's said it protects believers.

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:09.100
So, it means us no harm?

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:12.000
Well, it supposedly protects us, so...

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:16.640
Crash! Crash! Crash!

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.360
It might even be a lucky omen!

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:16.640
Really? I'm so grateful!

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.090
No, I don't think that 
thing's quite so admirable.

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:20.710
Kersmash!

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.680
This has to be a joke, right?

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:38.600
I'm not feeling grateful at all.

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:43.100
What's this? Why would our 
kingdom's guardian deity do this?

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:44.440
Your Majesty?!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.110
May we ask you for more details?

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:49.520
That is our kingdom's 
ancient defense weapon...

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:50.690
Mehpon!

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:54.240
That adorable appearance does more 
than dampen fighting spirits.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.840
It possesses enough power 
to change the terrain.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:59.450
It is a gift from our goddess!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:03.960
<b>Yaaaaay!</b>

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.310
Isn't it cute?!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.440
That answer absolutely explains 
its ridiculous form.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:03.960
<i>Isn't it cute?!</i>

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:08.430
And unless two of the royal family,
 each bearing the holy crest, are together,

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:09.910
it shouldn't activate at all.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.530
How can this be?

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:13.030
Which means...

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:15.250
It was the princess and Tachibana.

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.310
<i>Tachibana...</i>

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:21.080
So... What about a way to defeat it?

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:22.940
I don't know or care about that!

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:26.190
Blast it. The reactions 
are bigger than I thought!

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.130
Modifying course.

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:30.530
<i>Hey! Don't take it off this course!</i>

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:34.230
With a weapon this difficult to handle, 
the first shot is incredibly important!

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:36.830
<i>Oh, pipe down! I'll hit the target next time!</i>

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:43.250
It's coming again!

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.170
Your Majesty! Please run!

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.810
What are you doing, Jinguuji-san?!

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:57.890
Schwartz, what I know as "adults" 
are not simple creatures.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:00.040
In something like a love affair...

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.470
the darkness runs deep. Truly.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:05.390
<i>When someone with a handsome face 
says that, it sounds more convincing.</i>

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:08.950
And Tachibana is no exception to that.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.650
Until just now, that's what I believed.

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:13.800
Its appearance might be ridiculous,

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:16.610
but that is undoubtedly a killing machine.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:19.740
Tachibana would never voluntarily 
do something like this.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.150
Jinguuji-san...

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:23.110
Whether that thing has gone out of control

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:25.830
or is being controlled by someone...

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:28.830
I have a duty to stop it!

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:36.500
Well, I can't let you show 
off all on your own, can I?

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:38.340
Schwartz...

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:43.000
We're probably the only ones in
 this castle who can stop that thing.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.640
If we don't stand and face it, who will?!

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:48.850
That's what this is, right?

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:50.910
Yes, that's right!

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:53.360
Well, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:55.490
Huh?

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:59.630
When I'm away from Tachibana,
I lose my supernatural strength.

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:00.860
I'm weak.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:02.270
I won't be any help at all.

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:03.960
What? Really?

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:08.200
No, Jinguuji-san, we're talking about you. 
You must have some kind of plan, right?

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.250
I have nothing of the sort.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.750
You don't?!

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:13.930
His sword can cut through anything, right?

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:16.400
Then couldn't it cut through that beam?

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:17.990
I see. Let's go with that.

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:19.260
Whaaa?!

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:21.040
No, wait, hang on!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.100
Are we okay with using such 
a thrown-together plan?!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:25.120
You ask that, but...

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.770
We don't have time to think about it, do we?

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:28.100
Do your best.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:29.020
Do your best.

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:30.900
W-Wait!

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:34.440
Are you listening? If you mess up, 
everyone will die.

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:39.640
This way! Don't panic!

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:43.410
Fire!

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:07.990
We're saved... right?

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:10.060
Impressive. You're able to do things now.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:16.480
I get it. I get it already! 
I just have to do it, right?!

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:21.240
If I don't do it, then lots of 
people will die! And I'll die, too!

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:23.450
You've become more like a hero.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.120
No one asked you!

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:29.600
Humans! Well done surviving that attack!

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.730
I praise you for it!

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:33.620
What's that voice? Is it coming 
from inside that thing?

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:35.130
I feel like I've heard it somewhere.

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:38.630
As a reward, I shall tell you my name.

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:41.270
I am Vizzd the Incomparably Skilled!

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:43.180
A top officer of the Demon Lord's forces!

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:46.740
Humans, I shall take you to the 
world of the dead as souvenirs!

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:47.510
Oh, it's her.

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:50.640
If we're facing the Demon Lord's forces, 
then there's no reason to hold back.

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:53.060
I'm definitely gonna cut it to pieces!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.650
You're doing great! Morale is high!

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.200
You can win! You can beat it!

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:58.650
No one asked you!

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:02.560
Cut this Mehpon to pieces, you say?

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:04.660
You sure talk big, you background character!

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:08.520
Huh? Could it be it can hear our voices?

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:10.040
What kind of technology is that?

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:12.270
Do it, if you think you can!

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:16.230
But I don't know what'll happen 
to the hero inside this thing!

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:18.800
Argh! Tachibana-san's inside that thing?

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:21.000
That's a cowardly trick!

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.550
Now, don't say that, Schwartz.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:27.000
<i>It doesn't make sense to call 
such a young child "cowardly."</i>

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.890
It's actually the perfect level 
of handicap for us, isn't it?

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.390
Y-You little...

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:36.800
You are the one person 
I'm definitely gonna kill, Four-Eyes!

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:41.520
Why would you provoke her?!

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:44.380
Okay. Get ready to 
counterattack, Schwartz.

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:44.950
Huh?

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:52.150
Did I get them?

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:59.420
Were Four-Eyes and the 
background character vaporized?

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.130
<i>Of course not!</i>

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:03.850
You missed! They got away!

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:06.130
This is your fault for acting
 like everything's easy!

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:10.190
<i>You should have defeated them with 
repeated fire before things came to this!</i>

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:12.450
Mehpon can't do rapid fire.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:15.840
It has to cool down after each adorable beam.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:17.970
<i>Then why did you waste shots?!</i>

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:19.510
Don't call them wasted shots!

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:20.910
I had a snappy conversation

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:23.620
to buy time so they wouldn't 
notice the weakness, didn't I?

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:25.760
<i>What do you mean "snappy conversation"?!</i>

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.910
<i>Thanks to that, they know 
where the hero is, too!</i>

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:32.240
<i>Why do you think you were talking 
with Four-Eyes and the hero?</i>

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:35.410
<i>It's because if he gets close, 
he'll be dangerous!</i>

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:40.440
Oh, be quiet! I just have to make 
it so he doesn't get close, right?!

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:46.560
I'll leave the landing to you!

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:49.180
No, no, no, no, no!

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.520
What was that, all of a sudden?!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:57.560
The provocation was meant 
to make her target us.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.810
And she's lost sight of her target,

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.520
the castle will probably 
avoid damage for a while.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:05.690
Mehpon probably can't shoot continuously.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:09.770
It took time between the 
first and second shots,

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:14.080
and if also consider that unnatural conversation
 was just to buy time, it makes sense.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:18.550
Based on what Vizzd said, we can surmise 
that Tachibana is inside the robot.

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:20.960
So we'll use this time to get closer to it.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:24.800
If we get close, I'll be able to help 
fight and our chances will increase.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.740
That is all. Any questions?

00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:28.470
Well, let's see...

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.530
That line, "That is all. Any questions?"

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:34.880
Can I add it to my list of things 
I want to say at least once in my life?

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:37.350
Hurry up. The next beam is coming.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:39.270
Jinguuji-san!

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:41.730
It's a crocodog. Please make use of it!

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:50.160
This place...

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.280
I seem to be floating.

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.520
What is this place?

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.660
Where was I again?

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:03.540
What's this? Is someone shooting 
a beam or something?

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:07.050
Is it fighting with something?

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:13.070
Jinguuji...

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:21.940
Life with an Ordinary Guy who Reincarnated into a Total Fantasy Knockout

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.280
Mehpon!

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:21.940
Master?

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.190
Jinguuji Tsukasa.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:28.160
As you have achieved high 
outstanding scores in kendo,

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:29.440
we present you with this award.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.360
Jinguuji's amazing!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:34.070
That guy really can do anything.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.790
Man, I want one, too!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.370
Take that!

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.410
What's with that sword?!

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:54.020
Some idiot must have thought 
that sword up, right?!

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:55.220
<i>It does possess a very bizarre power.</i>

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.300
Blast it. Are there any countermeasures?

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:59.610
<i>Mehpon isn't good at close combat!</i>

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:01.730
<i>If they get close, we're gonna lose!</i>

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:05.240
Can't you use that strange power like before?

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:07.860
<i>It takes time for that to deploy.</i>

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:11.050
<i>That means you're pretty much useless, too!</i>

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:13.610
My abilities lie in covert specializations.

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:16.120
We're not gonna get anywhere at this rate.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.030
If the next attack gets deflected,

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:20.530
they'll get close for sure 
and then it's kaboom!

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:24.800
In which case, all that's left is to 
challenge them with all the power we have left!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:27.730
<i>Idiot! That's an idiotic train of thought!</i>

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:30.710
<i>Don't do it! If you use full power, 
the reaction will be too big and—</i>

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.160
Stupid! Stupid! Shut up!

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:33.720
I'm firing! Fire!

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.470
<i>Wait!</i>

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:38.260
Huh? What happened? 
Is there some kind of bug?

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:40.390
<i>Hey, is everything all right?</i>

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.000
What?

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.700
Everything's going pitch black!

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:47.860
<i>What? What happened? What's going on?</i>

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:49.610
We're close!

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:51.880
We'll go around and head in from below!

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:53.960
It won't be able to shoot those 
beams very well behind itself!

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.480
Jinguuji-san! Look up!

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:04.210
Switching attack patterns when 
we get close is quite impertinent.

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:07.440
Your thinking's better than 
I guessed, you rotten brat!

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.710
<i>Sorry for being a rotten brat!</i>

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:12.340
That voice! Is that you, Tachibana?

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.590
Kalm!

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:19.350
<i>I didn't do anything, but Mehpon's broken!</i>

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.930
<i>It's totally dark and I haven't 
input anything, but it's moving!</i>

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:25.030
<i>Is this a rampage?</i>

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:26.160
A rampage?

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:29.400
Is it because I pushed you too hard?
 I'm sorry, Mehpon!

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.490
<i>No, not Mehpon...</i>

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:33.150
<i>It's the hero inside.</i>

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:34.170
What?

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:37.450
Tachibana! I'm glad you're safe!

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:41.200
You're inside Mehpon, right? 
Can you get out on your own?

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.450
Huh? Why would I get out?

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:47.390
I've gotten my hands on 
this incredible power.

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:49.890
I'm not gonna give it up that easily!

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:51.710
Something seems strange, doesn't it?

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:53.940
Jinguuji...

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:56.160
I will defeat you!

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:57.220
Why?!

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:59.180
I came here to rescue you!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:01.720
You're always doing that, 
aren't you, Jinguuji?

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:04.550
That's right. You can do anything.

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:06.510
Is it fun looking down on people?

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:08.300
You're popular with women,

00:18:08.300 --> 00:18:10.980
and you don't hide your thoughts 
about it; you hate it!

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:13.480
And bosses like you, too, because 
you're good at your work!

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:15.740
I hate you for all of that!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:18.170
...hate! ...hate! ...hate!

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:19.690
What is this all of a sudden?

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:20.580
No idea.

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:22.320
Did you fight or something?

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:24.650
No, I don't feel like we 
did anything like that...

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:26.140
Shut up, you idiot!

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:30.000
I've got stuff bottled up 
inside me even if you don't!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.000
Kersmash!

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:37.510
Strength is flooding through me. 
And it's a crushing power at that!

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:40.430
This is the first time 
I've felt like this in all my life!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:44.080
Does anyone these days say 
cheesy lines like that?

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:46.770
I don't think Tachibana wants
 to hear that from you.

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.760
Things seem to be getting more complicated...

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:50.780
Should we execute a brute force rescue?

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:53.430
Now that we're close, 
your strength has returned, right?

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:55.020
Well, about that...

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:58.610
In spite of getting closer, 
my strength hasn't returned.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:01.210
What?! But that means you're useless!

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:03.600
Hey, what are you going to 
do about this situation?!

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:07.910
I thought that my power's waning had to 
do with my distance from Tachibana...

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:07.910
Hey! Hey, Four-Eyes!

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:11.190
<i>Does the fact that a info 
window hasn't appeared</i>

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:11.190
<b>Information</b>

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:11.190
Blessings of the Goddess of Love MAX 

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:12.920
<i>mean that there's a different reason?</i>

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.380
Tachibana! Why?

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:22.280
It's true that I'm popular with women, 
but that's a different issue!

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:24.360
Why would something like that 
affect you after all this time?!

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:26.220
I think it might be because you're like that.

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:29.420
Why? That should be obvious.

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:33.480
Because I want to be praised!

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:36.230
Huh?

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:38.360
You don't know, do you, Jinguuji?

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:41.990
How I've been treated while 
I've been around you.

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:45.490
Like trailing goldfish crap, 
or a suckerfish...

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:49.120
The opinions of everyone
 around me were horrible!

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.250
Whoa...

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:52.020
And on top of that, you...

00:19:52.020 --> 00:19:53.680
You! You! You!

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:54.500
Me?!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:58.160
Have you ever once, in your 
whole life, praised me?!

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.570
No, you haven't!

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:01.930
So I'll just get stronger 
than you, like this,

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:05.430
and have you praise me for it!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:08.050
What are we going to do about this?!

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:09.890
You ask me, but...

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.540
Enough already, right?

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.850
Just give some random praise about anything!

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:16.940
Anything... just randomly?

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:19.560
Hey, Tachibana!

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.030
Huh? What is it?

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:22.060
You're...

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:24.530
really cool... you know?

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.330
You're saying stuff you don't mean!

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.080
How bad at this can you be?!

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:31.450
Jinguuji-san!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.650
Phew〜

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:40.000
A Japanese door is built to withstand
 the country's frequent earthquakes.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.720
It's sturdy. Not a scratch on it.

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:44.090
You can use it like that?

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:46.000
Hey, Tachibana!

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:48.600
No matter the circumstances, 
that was entirely too dangerous!

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.270
If it were anyone but me, they'd be dead—

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:51.020
<i>Must be nice to be you.</i>

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:54.840
<i>You're always being told you're 
amazing, or that you're cool...</i>

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:59.360
<i>No one's ever used those 
words of praise for me.</i>

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:01.760
<i>And you're the same, right?</i>

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:05.140
<i>You're saying there's not a 
single thing to praise about me.</i>

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:06.110
<i>But you know...</i>

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:09.700
what's wrong with me getting 
fawned over a little?

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.130
<i>What's wrong, Tachibana?</i>

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:13.790
<i>You're throwing a tantrum like a child!</i>

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.660
Shut up!

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:17.100
I know that!

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.570
I'm not doing this because I want to.

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:22.860
I know that what I'm saying is childish.

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:25.710
But, you know... being an adult...

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:28.640
I'm not as grown up as you think!

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:31.420
<i>My looks, my brains, my athleticism...</i>

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:33.970
<i>I'm not gifted in anything!</i>

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:35.580
<i>It's because I've got nothing!</i>

00:21:36.070 --> 00:21:37.420
Tachibana-san...

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.670
And getting called
 "trailing goldfish crap"...

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:45.390
is because I've got nothing 
that's equal to what you have!

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:48.080
And no matter how cute I might look,

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:51.400
if I'm worthless to you, 
then it doesn't mean anything!

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:53.710
And the reason I'm suffering 
so much right now...

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:57.080
is because the only thing I can brag 
about is having you as a friend!

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:03.460
It's because I'm a person with nothing!

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:08.720
<b>with</b>

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:37.100
I will now read a letter.

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:40.180
"I have a question about that 
dog-like, crocodile-like animal."

00:23:40.180 --> 00:23:41.520
Oh, the crocodog, right?

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:43.100
"What sound does it make?"

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Episode 12 

00:23:43.420 --> 00:23:44.230
I see.

00:23:44.230 --> 00:23:46.800
Well, let's listen to its actual call.

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:48.280
Make a sound. Come on. Make a sound.

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:49.990
Woof! Woof!

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:49.990
Okay! See you next week!
